			"isCommand": false,
			"name": "seira",
			"expression": "",
			"string": "...hey, hey.",
			"key": "dbdEnd19",
			"side": "left"
		},
		{
			"isCommand": false,
			"name": "seira",
			"expression": "",
			"string": "No need to be like that, I understood it was that disgusting blue-haired woman who stole my microphone, no need to cry-",
			"key": "dbdEnd20",
			"side": "left"
		},
		{
			"isCommand": false,
			"name": "manuel",
			"expression": "sad",
			"string": "That's not the point...",
			"key": "dbdEnd21",
			"side": "right"
		},
		{
			"isCommand": false,
			"name": "seira",
			"expression": "hmm",
			"string": "Huh? No? Then why? Did something happen after our... unconventional duet?",
			"key": "dbdEnd22",
			"side": "left"
		},
		{
			"isCommand": false,
			"name": "manuel",
			"expression": "sad",
			"string": "...I got rid of everyone...I killed everyone.",
			"key": "dbdEnd23",
			"side": "right"
                },
		{
			"isCommand": false,
			"name": "manuel",
			"expression": "sad",
			"string": "Temporarily, but I killed them...And I feel horrible about it...I feel like a monster",
			"key": "dbdEnd24",
			"side": "right"
                },
		{
			"isCommand": false,
			"name": "manuel",
			"expression": "sad",
			"string": "I was so upset about the situation that... that I just did the first thing that came to mind...",
			"key": "dbdEnd25",
			"side": "right"
                },
		{
			"isCommand": false,
			"name": "manuel",
			"expression": "sad",
			"string": "So… I hurt people. I hurt Kaity. I killed her boyfriend, and she was very mad at me...",
			"key": "dbdEnd26",
			"side": "right"
                },
		{
			"isCommand": false,
			"name": "manuel",
			"expression": "cry",
			"string": "I just want my friends...I just want my sister...I just want to go home...I...",
			"key": "dbdEnd27",
			"side": "right"
